# Mirror of the repo-root .prettierignore entries for the devstack-emitted
# projection trees. Prettier only loads .prettierignore from its CWD, so any
# prettier run (or editor format-on-save) rooted in sandbox/ bypasses the root
# file and reformats the tab-indented emitter output — this mirror closes that
# hole. Keep in sync with the repo-root .prettierignore.
devstack-plugins/src/generated/
devstack-plugins/__tests__/src/generated/
devstack-plugins/dashboard-ui/
